<template><section id="linux-terminal" class="linux-terminal" aria-labelledby="linux-terminal-title"><header class="terminal-heading"><h2 id="linux-terminal-title"><button type="button" class="terminal-title" :aria-expanded="opened" aria-controls="linux-terminal-content" @click="opened=!opened"><ToolEntryIcon name="开发" />Linux 终端练习室 <span aria-hidden="true">{{opened?'▾':'▸'}}</span></button></h2><div><span>{{commands.length}} 个模拟命令</span><button type="button" :aria-expanded="opened" aria-controls="linux-terminal-content" @click="opened=!opened">{{opened?'收起 ▴':'展开 ▾'}}</button></div></header><div v-if="opened" id="linux-terminal-content"><p>浏览器内虚拟环境，不是远程 Linux 或完整 Bash。文件、权限、进程与网络均为模拟；不执行本机命令，不安装软件，不发送 ping 请求。支持的参数以 help／man 为准。虚拟文件仅主动保存后留在此浏览器。</p><div class="terminal-toolbar"><button type="button" @click="prepare('help')">命令帮助</button><button type="button" @click="clearScreen">清屏</button><button type="button" @click="save">保存练习</button><button type="button" @click="askLoad=true">读取已保存练习</button><button type="button" @click="askReset=true">重置练习</button><button type="button" @click="download">导出终端记录</button></div><div v-if="askReset" class="terminal-confirm"><p>重置会清空当前虚拟文件、历史和任务进度；浏览器中主动保存的副本不变。</p><button type="button" @click="reset">确认重置虚拟文件</button><button type="button" @click="askReset=false">取消重置</button></div><div v-if="askLoad" class="terminal-confirm"><p>读取会替换当前未保存的虚拟练习内容。</p><button type="button" @click="load">确认读取已保存练习</button><button type="button" @click="askLoad=false">取消读取</button></div><div class="terminal-layout"><div class="terminal-workspace"><div ref="screen" class="terminal-screen" role="region" aria-label="Linux 终端交互区" @click="focusTerminal"><div role="log" aria-label="Linux 模拟终端输出" aria-live="polite"><p class="terminal-welcome">Linux Lab · virtual shell<br />欢迎练习。输入 help；上下键历史，Tab 补全，Ctrl+L 清屏，Ctrl+C 取消输入。</p><div v-for="(entry,i) in entries" :key="i" class="terminal-entry"><pre v-if="entry.command" class="terminal-input-record">{{entry.prompt}} {{entry.command}}</pre><pre v-if="entry.output" :class="{'terminal-error':entry.code!==0}">{{entry.output}}</pre></div></div><form class="terminal-input-form" @submit.prevent="submit"><label for="linux-command-input" class="terminal-prompt">student@linux-lab:{{promptPath}}$</label><input id="linux-command-input" ref="commandInput" v-model="input" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" aria-label="输入 Linux 练习命令" placeholder="输入 help 查看命令" maxlength="2048" @keydown="onKey" /></form></div><p class="terminal-state">退出码：{{state.lastExit}} · 虚拟目录：{{state.cwd}} · {{Object.keys(state.fs).length}} 个文件／目录</p></div><aside class="terminal-lessons" aria-label="Linux 练习任务"><h3>练习任务 {{state.completed.length}} / {{tasks.length}}</h3><p>点击提示只填入命令，按 Enter 执行；完成后自动打勾。</p><ol><li v-for="task in tasks" :key="task.id"><span>{{state.completed.includes(task.id)?'✓':'○'}} {{task.title}}</span><button type="button" :aria-label="'填入练习：'+task.title" @click="prepare(task.hint)">{{task.hint}}</button></li></ol></aside></div><p role="status">{{feedback}}</p><details><summary>支持范围与命令速查</summary><p>支持单／双引号、反斜杠、$NAME／$?、基础 *／? 文件名匹配、管道、输入输出重定向和 ;／&amp;&amp;／||。不实现完整变量分词、脚本、后台任务、命令替换、正则 grep 或真实权限；cp -r 不合并已存在目录。单文件 64K 字符，总内容 512K 字符，最多 600 个条目。</p><div class="terminal-command-list"><button v-for="command in commands" :key="command" type="button" @click="prepare('man '+command)">{{command}}</button></div><a href="https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/manual/html_node/Basic-Shell-Features.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GNU Bash 语法参考 ↗</a><a href="https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/manual/coreutils.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GNU Coreutils 命令参考 ↗</a></details></div></section></template>
<script>
import ToolEntryIcon from './ToolEntryIcon.vue';
import {createTerminalState,runTerminalLine,completeTerminal,terminalCommands,terminalTasks,validateTerminalSave} from '../utils/linux-terminal.mjs';
const SAVE_KEY='01-linux-terminal-practice';
export default {name:'LinuxTerminal',components:{ToolEntryIcon},data:()=>({opened:false,state:createTerminalState(),commands:terminalCommands,tasks:terminalTasks,entries:[],input:'',feedback:'',historyIndex:-1,draft:'',askReset:false,askLoad:false}),computed:{promptPath(){return this.state.cwd==='/home/student'?'~':this.state.cwd.startsWith('/home/student/')?'~'+this.state.cwd.slice(13):this.state.cwd;}},methods:{focusTerminal(event){if(event.target.closest('input,button,a,textarea,select')||window.getSelection()?.toString())return;this.$refs.commandInput?.focus();},prompt(){return 'student@linux-lab:'+this.promptPath+'$';},scroll(){this.$nextTick(()=>{if(this.$refs.screen)this.$refs.screen.scrollTop=this.$refs.screen.scrollHeight;});},prepare(command){this.input=command;this.$nextTick(()=>this.$refs.commandInput?.focus());},submit(){const command=this.input;if(!command.trim())return;const prompt=this.prompt();const result=runTerminalLine(this.state,command);this.state=result.state;this.input='';this.historyIndex=-1;this.draft='';this.feedback='';if(result.clear)this.entries=[];if(!result.clear||result.output)this.entries.push({prompt,command,output:result.output,code:result.code});if(this.entries.length>200)this.entries=this.entries.slice(-200);this.scroll();},clearScreen(){this.entries=[];this.feedback='屏幕已清空，虚拟文件和任务保留';},onKey(event){if(event.key==='ArrowUp'){event.preventDefault();if(this.historyIndex<0){this.draft=this.input;this.historyIndex=this.state.history.length;}this.historyIndex=Math.max(0,this.historyIndex-1);this.input=this.state.history[this.historyIndex]||'';}else if(event.key==='ArrowDown'){event.preventDefault();if(this.historyIndex<0)return;this.historyIndex++;if(this.historyIndex>=this.state.history.length){this.historyIndex=-1;this.input=this.draft;}else this.input=this.state.history[this.historyIndex];}else if(event.key==='Tab'&&!event.shiftKey){event.preventDefault();const result=completeTerminal(this.state,this.input);this.input=result.line;if(result.candidates.length>1){this.entries.push({prompt:'',command:'',output:result.candidates.join('  '),code:0});this.scroll();}}else if(event.ctrlKey&&event.key.toLowerCase()==='l'){event.preventDefault();this.clearScreen();}else if(event.ctrlKey&&event.key.toLowerCase()==='c'){event.preventDefault();this.entries.push({prompt:this.prompt(),command:this.input+'^C',output:'',code:130});this.state.lastExit=130;this.input='';this.historyIndex=-1;this.scroll();}},save(){try{localStorage.setItem(SAVE_KEY,JSON.stringify(this.state));this.feedback='虚拟文件、历史和任务已保存到此浏览器';}catch{this.feedback='保存未完成，可先导出终端记录';}},load(){this.askLoad=false;try{const text=localStorage.getItem(SAVE_KEY);if(!text){this.feedback='没有已保存的练习';return;}if(text.length>1200000)throw Error('保存内容过大');this.state=validateTerminalSave(JSON.parse(text));this.entries=[];this.input='';this.historyIndex=-1;this.feedback='已读取练习，工作目录和文件已恢复';}catch(e){this.feedback='读取未完成：'+e.message;}},reset(){this.state=createTerminalState();this.entries=[];this.input='';this.historyIndex=-1;this.askReset=false;this.feedback='虚拟练习环境已重置，浏览器保存副本未删除';},download(){const text=['Linux 终端模拟练习记录（非真实主机执行）',...this.entries.flatMap(e=>[(e.prompt+' '+e.command).trim(),e.output]),'当前退出码：'+this.state.lastExit].join('\n'),url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([text],{type:'text/plain;charset=utf-8'})),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='linux-practice.txt';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);}}};
</script>
<style scoped>.linux-terminal{margin:32px 20px;padding:20px;font-size:13px;scroll-margin-top:80px;}.terminal-heading,.terminal-heading>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;}h2{margin:0;}.terminal-title{border:0!important;background:transparent!important;padding:0;text-align:left;font:inherit;}button,input{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;color:inherit;border:1px solid var(--el-border-color);background:var(--el-fill-color-blank);box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;}button{cursor:pointer;}.terminal-toolbar,.terminal-command-list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:14px 0;}.terminal-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,2fr) minmax(240px,1fr);gap:16px;}.terminal-workspace,.terminal-lessons{min-width:0;}.terminal-screen{box-sizing:border-box;cursor:text;background:#09110c;color:#b0d4ba;border:1px solid #344b3d;height:390px;overflow:auto;padding:14px;border-radius:5px;font:13px/1.7 Consolas,monospace;}.terminal-screen pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin:5px 0;font:inherit;}.terminal-input-record{color:#96d9ae;}.terminal-error{color:#efc187;}.terminal-welcome{color:#8ca995;}.terminal-input-form{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;padding:0;margin:5px 0;border:0;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#b0d4ba;}.terminal-input-form input{flex:1 1 140px;min-width:0;font:inherit;color:#b0d4ba!important;background:transparent!important;border:0!important;border-radius:0!important;outline:none!important;box-shadow:none!important;padding:0;caret-color:#b0d4ba;line-height:1.7;}.terminal-input-form input::placeholder{color:#6f927b;}.terminal-input-form:focus-within{box-shadow:inset 2px 0 #52735d;padding-left:6px;}.terminal-screen .terminal-prompt{color:#96d9ae;font:inherit;line-height:1.7;}.terminal-prompt{font:12px Consolas,monospace;overflow-wrap:anywhere;max-width:100%;}.terminal-lessons{padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--el-border-color-light);background:var(--el-fill-color-blank);}.terminal-lessons h3{margin:0;font-size:15px;}.terminal-lessons ol{padding-left:20px;}.terminal-lessons li{margin:12px 0;line-height:1.7;}.terminal-lessons button{display:block;width:100%;font:11px/1.7 Consolas,monospace;text-align:left;overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal;}.terminal-confirm{border:1px solid var(--ui-accent);padding:12px;margin:12px 0;}.terminal-confirm button{margin-right:8px;}p{line-height:1.8;color:var(--el-text-color-secondary);}summary{cursor:pointer;}a{display:inline-block;color:var(--ui-accent);margin:10px 14px 0 0;}@media(max-width:1000px){.terminal-layout{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);}}@media(max-width:600px){.linux-terminal{margin:16px 12px;padding:14px;}.terminal-screen{height:320px;padding:10px;}.terminal-input-form{padding:0;gap:5px;}.terminal-screen .terminal-prompt{font-size:12px;}.terminal-input-form input{flex-basis:120px;}}</style>
